{"2387700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Settle Gliese", "steam_appid": 2387700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settle Gliese is a collaborative colony simulator game set in a massive dangerous world. It’s a massively multiplayer game where each player attempts to control a family of settlers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Familiar colony sim features you know and love</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign orders to your characters and grow your settlement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a deep tech tree and have players be farmers, miners, cooks, builders, etc.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through wild continents and discover the settlements and communities of other players </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique biomes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take on a role</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a unique culture with laws, customs, and traditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on building, creativity, and society </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk, write notices for others, and craft personal items and artworks to shape the society they are a part of.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a Massively Multiplayer World</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborate to advance and survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the world  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover its secrets </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387700/extras/0f7ec4c84b512449a8d0496a3d392323.poster.avif?t=1785509888\" width=786 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste